mapping "W5662.1" source="W5662" target="220926003" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W5662 SNOMED CT 220926003 = Bitten or attacked by marine animal, industrial and construction
        area, förvärvsarbete. Target SNOMED CT 40417351 = [X]Contact with marine animal, occurrence at
        industrial and construction area. The SNOMED CT place-specific event concept fully contains the
        source (every industrial and construction area marine-animal event is such an occurrence); the
        activity dimension (förvärvsarbete) has no SNOMED CT representation, so the target is broader. High
        tier: the SNOMED CT [X] concept is the standard representation of the ICD-10 W56.6 place-occurrence
        code, and the Swedish code is its national extension with an added activity suffix.
        """
}
